commit c068a932c4e9ded7667ea4e61009075fa626dcdd
Author:     John Bieling <john@thunderbird.net>
AuthorDate: Fri Oct 18 22:56:14 2024 +0000
Commit:     John Bieling <john@thunderbird.net>
CommitDate: Fri Oct 18 22:56:14 2024 +0000

    Bug 1924898 - Add option to return raw message headers and raw message content. r=aleca

    Bug 1919244 revealed that extensions might need access to the raw
    message headers. This patch is adding two options to `getFull()`:
    * decodeHeaders
    * decodeContent

    This also adds a method to the messengerUtilities API to manually decode
    MIME headers.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D225738

